#: ops_slide.py:264
msgid "C while sliding. The key keeps its handles and follows the path itself. Timing: it moves in time and onto the path where the motion was at the new frame. Spacing: it slides along the path without retiming the frames around it. Past the first / last key the motion goes on"
msgstr "滑动时按 C。关键帧保留其控制柄并沿路径本身移动。时间：它在时间上移动，并移动到新帧处运动所在路径上的位置。间距：沿路径滑动，不重新调整周围帧的时间。超过第一个/最后一个关键帧后运动继续"

