#: ops_shape.py:495
#: ops_tools.py:1559
msgid "Center"
msgstr "中心"

#: props.py:502
#: props.py:919
msgid "Center of Mass"
msgstr "质心"

#: props.py:510
msgid "Center of mass: an arrow where the body is going (about 8 frames ahead)"
msgstr "质心：表示身体前进方向的箭头（约提前 8 帧）"

#: props.py:816
msgid "Center of mass: how a limb's weight is shown and set"
msgstr "质心：肢体重量如何显示和设置"

#: props.py:811
msgid "Center of mass: how closely the support area on the floor follows the feet (1: a grid of 2% of the character's height; higher: finer, a little more work while the pose changes). The ghosts' Detail sets how fine the meshes it's taken from are"
msgstr "质心：地面支撑区域跟随脚部的精细程度（1：角色身高的 2% 网格；更高：更精细，姿态变化时计算稍多）。残影的“细节”决定其所用网格的精细程度"

#: props.py:541
msgid "Center of mass: how much of the body's mass the active bone alone is, without its child bones (a hand without the fingers). The rest of the part it carries makes up for it"
msgstr "质心：仅活动骨骼（不含子骨骼）占身体质量的比例（例如不含手指的手）。其所属部位的其余部分会补足差额"

#: props.py:534
msgid "Center of mass: how much of the body's mass the active bone and what hangs on it are (the whole arm on the shoulder). Worked out from the meshes; set it where it's off and the other bones make up for it - the part keeps this weight also when a smaller part inside it gets its own. It lights up while it changes; the arrow: worked out again"
msgstr "质心：活动骨骼及其附属部分（肩部的整条手臂）占身体质量的比例。由网格计算得出；如果数值不对可手动设置，其他骨骼会补足——即使其中更小的部位有自己的权重，该部位仍保留此重量。变化时会高亮；箭头：重新计算"

#: props.py:507
msgid "Center of mass: its path over the frames (a jump's arc should be a parabola)"
msgstr "质心：其随帧变化的路径（跳跃弧线应为抛物线）"

#: props.py:566
msgid "Center of mass: only draw the trajectory around the current frame"
msgstr "质心：仅绘制当前帧附近的轨迹"

#: props.py:523
msgid "Center of mass: the arrow's length (Fixed) or what is added to it (Adaptive + Length)"
msgstr "质心：箭头长度（固定）或附加长度（自适应 + 长度）"

#: props.py:552
msgid "Center of mass: the character's whole mass in kilograms (only for showing the limbs' masses in kg / lb; the center itself only needs the shares)"
msgstr "质心：角色总质量（千克）（仅用于以 kg / lb 显示肢体质量；质心本身只需比例）"

#: props.py:803
msgid "Center of mass: the color a limb lights up in while its weight changes (the bones it carries)"
msgstr "质心：肢体重量变化时高亮的颜色（它承载的骨骼）"

#: props.py:807
msgid "Center of mass: the color of the bone itself in the lit up limb (and of the part Bone Weight changes)"
msgstr "质心：高亮肢体中骨骼本身的颜色（以及“骨骼权重”所改变部位的颜色）"

#: props.py:556
msgid "Center of mass: the frames its trajectory (and velocity) is worked out for"
msgstr "质心：计算其轨迹（和速度）所用的帧范围"

#: props.py:545
msgid "Center of mass: the mass of the active bone alone (in the unit set in the preferences)"
msgstr "质心：仅活动骨骼的质量（使用偏好设置中的单位）"

#: props.py:548
msgid "Center of mass: the mass of the limb this controller moves (its share of the Body Mass, in the unit set in the preferences)"
msgstr "质心：此控制器所移动肢体的质量（其占身体质量的比例，使用偏好设置中的单位）"

#: props.py:513
msgid "Center of mass: the outline of what touches the floor; the plumb point is green inside it (stable), red outside, gray in the air"
msgstr "质心：接触地面的物体轮廓；垂点在轮廓内为绿色（稳定），外为红色，悬空为灰色"

#: props.py:527
msgid "Center of mass: where the floor is (the plumb line ends there, the support is what touches it)"
msgstr "质心：地面位置（垂线终止于此，支撑面即接触地面的部分）"

#: props.py:601
msgid "Centered on the path of the tip"
msgstr "以末端路径为中心"

